{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-14","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与任意多边形等面积的正方形","englishTitle":"To construct a square equal to a given rectilineal figure.","book":2,"number":14,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.14","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.14/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":14,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","contentId":"euclid-2-14","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"53ebb58402304b4b07c5642d89bf5f4a32a83fbebe414493d924574699d751d8","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-14.statement","euclid-2-14.construction.1","euclid-2-14.construction.2","euclid-2-14.proof.1","euclid-2-14.proof.2","euclid-2-14.construction.3","euclid-2-14.construction.4","euclid-2-14.proof.3","euclid-2-14.proof.4","euclid-2-14.proof.5","euclid-2-14.construction.5","euclid-2-14.proof.6","euclid-2-14.proof.7","euclid-2-14.proof.8","euclid-2-14.conclusion","euclid-2-14.historical.1","euclid-2-14.historical.2","euclid-2-14.historical.3","euclid-2-14.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-14.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bfc0406932e125eb57dd3560c26c9f8e913972467b4386bcb16c2a85e2cbd1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To construct a square equal to a given rectilineal figure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"构建一个正方形等于给定直线数字。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有直线形求作直角方形与之等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有直线形求作正方形与之等"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c164c0e6a73fc294f5830c69bb3e9580e61a94d16d72e6d108235a2189a4f262","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be the given rectilineal figure; thus it is required to construct a square equal to the rectilineal figure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A是给出的直线数字;因此,需要构建一个正方形等于直线图A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"81ff0e3dfdd13e64b0483bcdd09a0050acad15bee5aa8b637d8fc32978bcb5aa","citations":["euclid-1-45"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let there be constructed the rectangular parallelogram BD equal to the rectilineal figure A. [[I. 45](/principles/euclid-1-45)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以构造矩形平行四边形 BD等于直线图A。 [[I. 45](/principles/euclid-1-45)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ed7bc2e2725e352f3d5fb638688af690f2c2bb8e1a11d46f7aaac3b620ea331","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, if BE is equal to ED, that which was enjoined will have been done; for a square BD has been constructed equal to the rectilineal figure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BE等于ED,那么按要求完成的任务就已经完成;正方形,BD的建造等于直线图A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de008eb331ce1c22561e265e5424ed184a88e889476f5921922a20476da36bbc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if not, one of the straight lines BE, ED is greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果不是,BE,ED直线中有一个线更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a760aa08ee05dbe69d92e345054ab2725e2b29d41ba07e3029461aeb0a78b24","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let BE be greater, and let it be produced to F; let EF be made equal to ED, and let BF be bisected at G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让BE变得更大,让F得到扩大;让EF得到ED,让BF在G时被分成两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d25150c327f469da0ee98a895d9a467bba8d338c4a97814bd7ef40ee80562d1b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"With centre G and distance one of the straight lines GB, GF let the semicircle BHF be described; let DE be produced to H, and let GH be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"中心G和直线之一的距离GB、GF让BHF半圆形图解;DE宽至H,让GH连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"00d428766e9c77603a4d1bb2d9d56670614d167c8053fed056aab5caeba11513","citations":["euclid-2-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line BF has been cut into equal segments at G, and into unequal segments at E, the rectangle contained by BE, EF together with the square on EG is equal to the square on GF. [[II. 5](/principles/euclid-2-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,由于BF线被划为G平段,E平段被划为不平等部分,BE和EF的矩形和EG的正方形和GF平段被划为等值部分。 [[II. 5](/principles/euclid-2-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a89881945e0e342b9e47236b1fd512eb163030ca14a6c797f09b6b517274fbe8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But GF is equal to GH; therefore the rectangle BE, EF together with the square on GE is equal to the square on GH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但GF等于GH,因此矩形 BE,EF加GE的正方形等于GH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"971a7bd8360b4ec4bcf67c1de912a2101b71b80e847af0fe23702e3a853caec4","citations":["euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on HE, EG are equal to the square on GH; [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)] therefore the rectangle BE, EF together with the square on GE is equal to the squares on HE, EG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,HE,EG的正方形等于GH的正方形;因此,矩形,BE,EF和GE的正方形等于HE,EG的正方形。 [[I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6319c85993f936cfd2377c37c4fac438432fda3c7203a17935d3ccb5ac5f5d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the square on GE be subtracted from each; therefore the rectangle contained by BE, EF which remains is equal to the square on EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将每架GE架正方形型飞机减去;因此,由BE架EF型组成的矩形型飞机等于EH架正方形型飞机。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af6f04f7b90f8131b9120bb368d899daa146a6ee71e2e10d90fa40df68fe9c04","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle BE, EF is BD, for EF is equal to ED; therefore the parallelogram BD is equal to the square on HE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 BE,EF是BD,EF等于ED;因此,平行四边形 BD等于HE的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ffcf2cd4991fb0455789c512b612f5f7e3d2dec19abedf6d52b0234d09d3fc0b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BD is equal to the rectilineal figure A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD等于直线图A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a59eafd7ae13239bb432c801526411d10f6285b745a27e525a6b6ab6cff63ba4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the rectilineal figure A is also equal to the square which can be described on EH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,直线图A也等于正方形,可描述为EH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56ab6d24d36793167fde0f79b2b227c3cd72560c4ba54f8503b5a2e37cc2bcfa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a square, namely that which can be described on EH, has been constructed equal to the given rectilineal figure A. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,建造了相当于EH直线图的正方形,即EH图,A,E,F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e9fc4f46a39d7cb0838b702e21d70756ec561f308cf80f9318b661d0a8bd99af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"有直线形求作直角方形与之等法曰甲直线无法四边形求作直角方形与之等先作乙丁形与甲等而直角〈一卷四五〉次任用一边引长之如丁丙引之至己而丙己与乙丙等次以丁巳两平分于庚其庚点或在丙点或在丙点之外若在丙即乙丁是直角方形与甲等矣〈盖丙己与乙丙等又与丙〉〈丁等而馀边俱相等故乙丁为直角方形见一卷卅四〉若庚在丙外即以庚为心丁巳为界作丁辛巳半圜末从乙丙线引长之遇圜界于辛即丙辛上直角方形与甲等论曰试自庚至辛作直线其丁巳线既两平分于庚又任两分于丙则丁丙偕丙巳矩内直角形〈即乙丁直角形〉〈盖丙己与乙丙等故〉及庚丙上直角方形并与等庚巳之庚辛上直角方形等〈本篇五〉夫庚辛上直角方形等于庚丙丙辛上两直角方形并〈一卷四七〉即乙丁直角形及庚丙上直角方形并与庚丙丙辛上两直角方形并等次各减同用之庚丙上直角方形则丙辛上直角方形与乙丁直角形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有一条直线，找一个正方形，依此类推。绘图方法如下：甲不能是四边形。要找到与甲相等的正方形，首先构造乙丁和甲，然后用一条边延伸直角〈一卷四五〉。例如，画丁丙到己，然后丙己和乙丙由丁巳在庚处平分。如果庚位于丙或丙之外，则乙丁是与甲相等的正方形。〈盖丙己与乙丙等又与丙〉〈丁等而馀边都相等故乙丁为正方形见一卷卅四〉 如果庚在丙之外，则庚为中心，而丁巳为边界。将丁辛巳画为半圆。从线的末端乙丙画圆以找到辛上的圆，即在丙辛上，正方形和甲如下。证明如下：如果庚在丙之外，则庚为中心，而丁巳为边界。将丁辛巳画为半圆。在直线的末端乙丙，画辛周围的圆，即在丙辛上，正方形和甲如下：画一条从庚到辛的直线。如果直线丁巳平分庚以及丙之间的任意两条分支，则丁丙和丙巳内的直角〈即乙丁矩形〉〈盖丙己与乙丙等故〉以及庚丙上的正方形等于庚巳和庚辛上的正方形，〈本篇五〉等于庚辛上的正方形和庚丙丙辛上的两个正方形，〈一卷四七〉是乙丁上的矩形和庚丙上的正方形，庚丙丙辛上的两个正方形之和等于庚丙上的正方形。庚丙上的正方形等于丙辛上的正方形和乙丁上的矩形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e04c7a825e9616e7d5b6717868f36bbd7dfe7df30d4d6abfb32c647d4b998505","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"増题凡先得直角方形之对角线所长于本形边之较而求本形边法曰直角方形之对角线所长于本形边之较为甲乙而求本形边先于甲乙上作甲丙直角方形次作乙丁对角线又引长之为丁戊线而丁戊与甲丁等即得乙戊线如所求论曰试于乙戊作戊己垂线从乙甲线引长之遇于己其乙戊己既直角而戊乙己为半直角〈一卷卅二〉即戊己乙亦半直角而戊乙与戊己两边等〈一卷六〉次作己庚与戊乙平行作乙庚与戊己平行即戊庚形为戊乙边上直角方形也末作戊甲线即丁戊甲丁甲戊两角等也〈一卷五〉夫乙戊己丁甲己既两皆直角试每减一相等之丁戊甲丁甲戊角即所存己戊甲己甲戊两角必等而己戊己甲两边必等〈一卷六〉则乙己对角线大于乙戊边之较为甲乙矣。〈此増不在本书，因其方形，故类附于此。〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"附加问题：首先确定正方形对角线与原形边的比例，然后计算主体边长，绘图方法如下：正方形对角线与框架边的比例为甲乙，要找到主边长，首先在甲乙上画甲丙，然后画乙丁。接下来，将对角线画到乙丁，然后延长成为直线丁戊，同时丁戊和甲丁相等，从而得到直线乙戊。证明如下：尝试在乙戊和戊己从直线乙甲画垂线。遇到己时，乙戊己为直角，戊乙己为半直角；〈一卷卅二〉是戊己乙也是半直角，戊乙和戊己在两侧相等。然后将〈一卷六〉与己庚和平行，乙庚和戊己平行；戊庚是边戊乙上的正方形，最后一条线是戊甲，意味着丁戊甲丁甲戊的两个角相等。〈一卷五〉和乙戊己丁甲己都是直角。尝试将一个相等的丁戊甲丁甲戊角减去己戊甲己甲戊角，这意味着己戊甲己甲戊的两个角必须相等，己戊己甲在两侧必须相等。然后〈一卷六〉 乙己的对角线与边乙戊的比例为甲乙。〈此増不在本书，因其方形，故类附于此。〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"36343cb92605345a75bf2f28c514526efb9fd18a738bd6be4a0e3002b7db7797","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"幾何原本卷二"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"原始几何 第二卷"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-14.source","contentId":"euclid-2-14","revisionId":"euclid-2-14@raw-53ebb58402304b4b","order":18,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d262e2a4409340589d35e3f7ca9a807fcb70cf80362529d35142e4eb8bd32c3f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.14/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.14\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-14:euclid-1-45:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-14.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-45","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.14","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.14/","sourceLabel":"I. 45"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-14:euclid-2-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-14","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-14.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_re